+//! The tray's window looks as the shell's own menus from the tray do
+//! (GNOME's popup menu, Yaru's): their surface and border colours, its
+//! corners rounded and clear, 6 points below the top bar. Opened from a
+//! click, it points at the item with an arrow, as the Mac's popover does:
+//! up from below a top bar, or down from above a bottom panel.
 
